# Debian package control file for callwarden-local
# Task: T-1783983162956-b2a8
# 角色 local: cw + Rust 扩展 + local DB + MCP + watcher（设计 §8.1 / §4.4）
# __VERSION__ / __ARCH__ 由 build_packages.sh 从 release/version.toml 注入

Package: callwarden-local
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Call Warden Team <team@callwarden.dev>
Description: Call Warden - Local CLI with code knowledge graph
 Call Warden provides multi-language code analysis, call graph
 tracking, and AI agent integration via MCP protocol.
 .
 This package includes:
  - cw CLI (local mode with SQLite + tree-sitter)
  - Rust extension (callwarden_core)
  - MCP stdio server
  - File watcher
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
# P0-3 整改（2026-07-22）：PyInstaller --onedir 已打包 Python 解释器 + 全部依赖，
# 不再需要系统 python3 / python3-tree-sitter 等。仅需 C 运行时库（PyInstaller 产物
# 动态链接 libc/libgcc/libstdc++）。
Recommends: git
